{"3677590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Breaking Deck", "steam_appid": 3677590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wanted to race your friends through a collapsing city, grind across lava bridges, or pull backflips over exploding cars — all while dropping traps behind you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to BREAKING DECK</strong> — a <strong>3D skateboarding PvP race party game</strong> where every map is a new kind of madness. Race, perform tricks, sabotage your friends, and survive the chaos long enough to cross the finish line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you win with style, you’re a legend. If you crash spectacularly — at least you looked cool doing it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 RACE WITH YOUR FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete across wild tracks in crazy settings — rooftops, factories, deserts, frozen highways, and more.<br>Grind, flip, and boost your way to victory while recording your best trick combos to climb the leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677590/extras/6d4fec83e144527719971ca04371ebef.poster.avif?t=1777481596\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677590/extras/6d4fec83e144527719971ca04371ebef.webm?t=1777481596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677590/extras/6d4fec83e144527719971ca04371ebef.mp4?t=1777481596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🧱 BUILD THE CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add ramps, rails, and traps mid-race to mess with everyone else.<br>Drop fans, swinging hammers, or falling platforms to send your friends flying.<br>Each run becomes unpredictable — no two races ever feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677590/extras/20f6068c495e3412bad5870eabab2069.poster.avif?t=1777481596\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677590/extras/20f6068c495e3412bad5870eabab2069.webm?t=1777481596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677590/extras/20f6068c495e3412bad5870eabab2069.mp4?t=1777481596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💥 FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D PvP Skateboarding Races</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique maps &amp; biomes</strong> with dynamic obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trick-based scoring system</strong> — the better you ride, the faster you boost</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build-as-you-play traps</strong> to sabotage opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online  multiplayer</strong> for up to 8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay system</strong> to flex your most ridiculous runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable skaters &amp; boards</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677590/extras/93eb3b78be553d4c2bbc3718210b4899.poster.avif?t=1777481596\" width=584 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677590/extras/93eb3b78be553d4c2bbc3718210b4899.webm?t=1777481596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9